{
 "version": 1,
 "name": "stone-golem",
 "archetype": "creature.humanoid.golem",
 "description": "A fantasy stone golem built from bevelled blocks of rock: short thick legs with knees and blocky feet, a pelvis, a belly and a massive chest, huge shoulder stones with glowing crystals growing from them, long heavy arms with elbows and fists that hang to the knees, and a small head sunk between the shoulders with a brow ridge, a jaw and glowing eyes. Runes carved on the chest and forearms glow, or are dark grooves when the glow is off. Every block is slightly off square from a seed. Arms, elbows, hands, legs, knees and the head are nodes with their pivot at the joint. Faces +Z, feet on y = 0.",
